    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38935" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōportĭōnālis</span></b> ,
			e, adj.
		proportio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			proportion</i>, <i>proportional</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">termini,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Front. Colon. p. 111</span></i>
			. —Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōportĭōnālĭter</span></b> ,
				adv., <i>proportionally</i>,
